        "audio_script": "Good morning, and a warm welcome to all of our new hires. My name is Cynthia, the Director of Human Resources, and I'll be leading your orientation today. You are joining us at a very exciting time, as we recently launched our new global marketing campaign to expand into the South American market. Today's schedule is quite full. We'll start with an overview of our corporate policies, followed by a facility tour. Then, at noon, you will be treated to a catered lunch in the cafeteria, where you'll have the opportunity to meet your respective department managers. Let's get started by having everyone introduce themselves and state which department they will be working in.",
