        "audio_script": "May I have your attention, please. This is a public service announcement for all passengers traveling on the express commuter train to the central business district. Due to emergency track maintenance ahead near the Riverview Bridge, this train will be operating at a reduced speed for the next five miles. As a result, we anticipate a delay of approximately fifteen to twenty minutes arriving at Central Station. We apologize for the inconvenience this may cause to your morning commute. If you have a connecting outbound train at Central Station, please speak to a customer service agent on the platform upon arrival to get your ticket rebooked. Thank you for your patience.",
