        "content": "To: All Employees\nFrom: Facilities Management\nDate: October 12\nSubject: Office Relocation Instructions\n\nAs you are aware, our corporate headquarters will be moving to the new Apex Building at the end of the month. To ensure a -------- transition, we ask that all employees follow the packing guidelines distributed last week. \n\nPlease pack all non-essential items into the labeled boxes provided by your department heads. Personal belongings should be taken home -------- the moving weekend. --------. \n\nIT support staff will disconnect all computers and phones on Friday evening. Do not attempt to move any electronic equipment --------. If you have any questions, please contact the facilities desk.\n\nThank you for your cooperation.",
