        "set_id": "RC6-SET03",
        "context_type": "Letter",
        "content": "Dear Mr. Thompson,\n\nWe are writing to address your recent complaint regarding order #84920. We understand that your shipment arrived two weeks later than the estimated delivery date, and the packaging was damaged. \n\nWe take full responsibility for this --------. Our logistics partner experienced unexpected delays due to severe weather conditions in your region. However, this does not excuse the poor condition in which your items were delivered. --------. \n\nAs a gesture of goodwill, we have credited $50 to your account, which can be applied to any future --------. \n\nWe value your business and hope you will give us another opportunity to serve you better.\n\nSincerely,\nCustomer Care Team\nNova Electronics",
