        "set_id": "RC7-SET01",
        "context_type": "Memo",
        "content": "To: All Staff\nFrom: Facilities Management\nDate: March 15\nSubject: Upcoming Office Relocation\n\nThis is a reminder that our transition to the new headquarters on 5th Avenue will take place over the weekend of April 10-11. All employees are required to pack their personal belongings in the provided boxes by 5:00 P.M. on Friday, April 9. Please label each box clearly with your name and new desk number. Large equipment and furniture will be moved by our hired contractors, Swift Movers. If you have any fragile items, please notify us in advance.",
