        "context_type": "Letter",
        "content": "September 14\n\nCustomer Service Department\nOrion Appliances\n4500 Industrial Pkwy\nChicago, IL 60613\n\nDear Customer Service,\n\nI am writing to express my profound disappointment with the Orion T-500 toaster I purchased from your online store on September 1. When I first used it, the heating elements only functioned on one side, resulting in unevenly toasted bread. I contacted your support hotline on September 5 and was told a replacement would be shipped within three business days. However, it has been over a week, and I have neither received the replacement nor any update on its status.\n\nAs a long-time customer of Orion Appliances, I expect better service. I request that you either expedite the shipment of the replacement unit immediately or process a full refund to my original payment method.\n\nI look forward to your prompt response.\n\nSincerely,\nJonathan Reed",
