      {
        "set_id": "RC7-SET12",
        "context_type": "Double Passage (Form & Email)",
        "content": "[Form]\nCustomer Feedback Form\nName: Sarah Jenkins\nDate of Visit: May 14\nLocation: Downtown Branch\nFeedback: I visited your store yesterday to purchase a new smartphone. While the store was well-organized, I was very disappointed with the customer service. I waited for over 20 minutes before a sales representative approached me. When I finally asked for help, the representative seemed rushed and was unable to answer my questions about the phone's features. I expected a much better experience from your brand.\n\n[Email]\nTo: Sarah Jenkins <s.jenkins@email.com>\nFrom: Marcus Thorne, Store Manager <m.thorne@electrostore.com>\nDate: May 16\nSubject: Apology regarding your recent visit\n\nDear Ms. Jenkins,\n\nI am writing to sincerely apologize for your experience at our Downtown Branch on May 14. We strive to provide excellent customer service, and it is clear we fell short during your visit. \n\nWe were unexpectedly short-staffed that day due to illness, which led to longer wait times. However, this does not excuse the lack of knowledge displayed by our representative. We are taking your feedback seriously and will be conducting additional training for our sales team.\n\nAs a gesture of our goodwill, please accept the enclosed $50 gift card, valid at any of our store locations. We hope you will give us another chance to provide you with the stellar service you deserve.",
