      {
        "set_id": "RC7-SET13",
        "context_type": "Triple Passage (Memo, Web page, Email)",
        "content": "[Memo]\nTo: Global Marketing Team\nFrom: David Chen, Director\nDate: January 10\nSubject: Project Phoenix\n\nWe are officially launching \"Project Phoenix,\" our new campaign aimed at increasing brand awareness in the South American market. We will focus primarily on digital advertising and social media engagement. I would like everyone to brainstorm ideas for the campaign slogan and submit them to me by January 15.\n\n[Web Page]\nCompany Intranet: Project Phoenix Updates\nJanuary 18 Update:\nThank you to everyone who submitted slogan ideas. After careful consideration, we have selected \"Rise with Us,\" submitted by Maria Gomez. Maria's slogan perfectly captures the empowering message we want to convey. The design team will now begin creating visual assets incorporating this slogan.\n\n[Email]\nTo: Design Team\nFrom: Maria Gomez, Lead Designer\nDate: January 19\nSubject: Next Steps for Project Phoenix\n\nHi Team,\n\nI'm thrilled that my slogan was chosen for the new campaign! As discussed in the memo from David on January 10, our focus is on digital and social media. Let's start sketching out banner ads and social media posts that feature \"Rise with Us\" prominently. I'd like to review the initial drafts at our weekly meeting this Friday. Please ensure all designs align with the vibrant color palette we agreed upon last week.",
