        "set_id": "RC7-SET14",
        "context_type": "Triple Passage (Notice, Meeting Minutes, Email)",
        "content": "[Notice]\nAttention All Department Heads\nThe annual year-end financial audit will commence on December 1. External auditors from Apex Financial Group will be on-site for two weeks to review our records. Please ensure that all financial documents, including expense reports and invoices for the current fiscal year, are organized and readily available. A preliminary meeting with the auditors is scheduled for November 25 in Conference Room B.\n\n[Meeting Minutes]\nMeeting: Preliminary Audit Briefing\nDate: November 25\nAttendees: Department Heads, Apex Auditors\n\nKey Points Discussed:\n- Auditors require access to both digital and physical records.\n- IT department must provide temporary network access to the audit team by November 30.\n- The Sales department needs to submit their final Q4 revenue projections by December 5.\n- Any discrepancies found during the audit will be reported directly to the CEO.\n\n[Email]\nTo: IT Support Team\nFrom: Robert Vance, IT Director\nDate: November 28\nSubject: Auditor Access\n\nTeam, \nPlease refer to the minutes from the audit briefing. We need to set up guest accounts for the five auditors from Apex Financial Group. These accounts must have read-only access to our financial databases and be active starting next Monday. Let me know once this is completed.",
