      {
        "set_id": "RC7-SET15",
        "context_type": "Triple Passage (Advertisement, Email, Invoice)",
        "content": "[Advertisement]\nAtlas Corporate Relocation Services\nMoving your office? Let Atlas handle the heavy lifting. We specialize in seamless corporate relocations, ensuring minimal downtime for your business.\n\nOur comprehensive packages include:\n- Professional packing and unpacking\n- Secure transportation of sensitive equipment\n- IT infrastructure setup at the new location\n- Post-move cleaning services\n\nContact us today at 555-0198 for a free quote!\n\n[Email]\nTo: Atlas Corporate Relocation <info@atlasrelocation.com>\nFrom: Jessica Lin, Operations Manager <j.lin@techinnovate.com>\nDate: August 5\nSubject: Inquiry about services\n\nHello, \nMy company, Tech Innovate, is planning to move to a larger facility across town next month. We have a lot of specialized computer servers and monitors. Do your movers have experience handling delicate IT equipment? Also, we are interested in your post-move cleaning service. Could you provide a quote for moving a 50-person office?\n\n[Invoice]\nAtlas Corporate Relocation Services\nInvoice #4920\nDate: September 15\nBill To: Tech Innovate\n\nServices Rendered:\n- Standard Office Move (50 employees) ... $5,000\n- Specialized IT Equipment Handling ... $1,200\n- IT Infrastructure Setup ... $800\n- Post-Move Cleaning ... $500\n\nTotal Due: $7,500\nPlease submit payment within 30 days.",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "RC7-196",
            "question": "What is advertised about Atlas Corporate Relocation Services?",
            "options": {
              "A": "They offer discounts for small businesses.",
              "B": "They operate exclusively on weekends.",
              "C": "They aim to reduce business interruption during a move.",
              "D": "They sell office furniture and equipment."
            },
            "answer": "C",
            "explanation": "광고에서 비즈니스의 가동 중단 시간을 최소화(ensuring minimal downtime)해준다고 홍보하고 있으므로 (C)가 정답입니다."
          },
